    "original":"navame sarvāṅgasaṃpūrṇo bhavati || mṛtaścāhaṃ punarjāto jātaścāhaṃ punarmṛtaḥ | nānāyonisahasrāṇi mayā yānyuṣitāni vai || āhārā vividhā bhuktāḥ pītā nānāvidhāḥ stanāḥ | mātaro vividhā dṛṣṭāḥ pitaraḥ suhṛdastathā || avāṅmukhaḥ pīḍyamāno jantuścaiva samanvitaḥ | sāṃkhyaṃ yogaṃ samabhyasye puruṣaṃ pañcaviṃśakam || iti ||",
